title: "U1 · Modelo de datos del Directorio (5.1) — diagrama de clases"
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: "#F4ECEF"
    primaryBorderColor: "#7A1F3D"
    lineColor: "#7A1F3D"
    fontFamily: "Georgia"
---
classDiagram
  direction LR

  class Participant {
    +participantId : string
    +bicfi : string
    +name : string
    +type : ParticipantType
    +networkId : NetworkId
    +status : string
  }

  class Key {
    +keyType : KeyType
    +keyValue : string
    +owningParticipantId : string
    +status : KeyStatus
    +nationalIdHash : string [planificado fase 2]
    +registeredAt : datetime
    +updatedAt : datetime
  }

  class KeyRegistration {
    +registrationId : string
    +action : RegistrationAction
    +newParticipantId : string
    +status : RegistrationStatus
    +reasonCode : string
  }

  class Merchant {
    +creditorId : string «26.04»
    +networkId : NetworkId «26.01»
    +acquiringParticipantId : string «26.02/26.03»
    +merchantAlias : string
    +legalName : string
    +displayName : string «59»
    +city : string «60»
    +countryCode : string «58»
    +mcc : MccCode «52»
    +merchantGroupId : string
    +legacyMerchantId : string «26.05»
    +status : MerchantStatus
  }

  class CollectionMethod {
    +collectionMethodId : string
    +type : CollectionMethodType
    +account : Account
    +accountProduct : PACA_PACC
    +storeLabel : string «62.03»
    +terminalLabels : string[] «62.07»
    +status : string
  }

  class Account {
    +scheme : OTHR
    +id : string (tokenizable)
    +institutionCode : string
  }

  class MerchantRegistration {
    +registrationId : string
    +action : RegistrationAction
    +status : RegistrationStatus
    +reasonCode : string
  }

  class FraudIndicator {
    +flagged : boolean
    +source : string
    +reasonCode : string
    +reportedAt : datetime
  }

  class DirectoryEvent {
    +eventId : string
    +eventType : string
    +payload : object
    +occurredAt : datetime
  }

  Participant "1" o-- "0..*" Key : posee registro
  Key "1" <-- "0..*" KeyRegistration : prxy.001/002
  Participant "1" o-- "0..*" Merchant : adquirente
  Merchant "1" *-- "1..*" CollectionMethod : acredita en
  CollectionMethod "1" *-- "1" Account : liquida sobre
  Merchant "1" <-- "0..*" MerchantRegistration : alta / mod / baja
  KeyRegistration ..> FraudIndicator : señal de fraude
  MerchantRegistration ..> FraudIndicator : señal de fraude
  Merchant ..> DirectoryEvent : cambios notifican
  Key ..> DirectoryEvent : portabilidad notifica

  note for Merchant "El QR transporta creditorId (26.04).\nCuenta y producto NUNCA viajan en el payload:\nse resuelven en el directorio."
  note for CollectionMethod "1 sucursal = 1 registro con su alias\ny su cuenta.\nCaché solo perfil STC-C, TTL 2 h."
